# U-Boot environment access for fw_printenv/fw_setenv (libubootenv), used by RAUC's uboot backend (BOOT_ORDER, BOOT_A_LEFT, BOOT_B_LEFT).
# TODO(Story 1.6): PLACEHOLDER. The environment lives in the raw GPT partition `uboot_env` (32 KiB, wks offset 8128s). The device path is
# fixed by the wks; the environment size must equal U-Boot's CONFIG_ENV_SIZE, which the boot chain of Story 1.6 decides (assumed 0x8000).
# Device name, offset, env size
/dev/disk/by-partlabel/uboot_env 0x0 0x8000
